      <h2 id="auth-allowing-javascript-access-api-server_auth-allowed-origins" class="group scroll-mt-20">Allowing JavaScript-based access to the API server from additional hosts<a href="#auth-allowing-javascript-access-api-server_auth-allowed-origins" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">If you need to access the API server or OAuth server from a JavaScript application by using a different hostname, you can configure additional hostnames to allow.</p>
